{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Cycles\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Cycles\/ST"],"kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every simple cycle of a directed graph once, lazily: by least vertex (in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and among the cycles with one least vertex in the order a depth-first search from it, taking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out-edges in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outEdges"},{"type":"text","text":" order, meets them."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Cycles"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SimpleCycles.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cycles\/SimpleCycles.swift#L14"},"title":"DirectedSimpleCycles","externalID":"s:6Cycles014DirectedSimpleA0V","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedSimpleCycles"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedSimpleCycles","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles\/DirectedSimpleCycles\/Iterator"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles\/DirectedSimpleCycles\/maxLength"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles\/DirectedSimpleCycles\/makeIterator()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/documentation\/Cycles\/DirectedSimpleCycles\/Element"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/doc